id=di_rt_seccomp
name=DI red-team — seccomp /proc interception
version=v1
versionCode=1
author=redteam
description=Installs a SECCOMP_RET_USER_NOTIF filter on com.example.hydrasample and intercepts /proc/self/{maps,status,mounts} reads at the kernel boundary (below libc + raw SVC). Inert for other apps.
